  "description": "Princess Roxiana of Cantar seems destined for a life of happiness as she departs to wed her childhood fiancé, Prince Lucas. But when her carriage is ambushed by mysterious assailants, Roxiana finds she’s been betrayed. Branded a slave and stripped of her royal title, all hope appears lost…Until she is rescued by Grand Duke Floyd Lathean of Torcan. Roxiana must contend with dangerous forces, all while her feelings for the Duke grow. Betrayal or love, which will out?\n\n(Source: WEBTOON)",
